 민주국가의 결집을 촉구했다.","status":"single-origin","confidence":"medium","aboutActor":["urn:trace:run:9e101404-9b68-4941-9c47-6b903f0472d6:Actor:e-lai"],"describes":["urn:trace:run:9e101404-9b68-4941-9c47-6b903f0472d6:Event:e-speech","urn:trace:run:9e101404-9b68-4941-9c47-6b903f0472d6:Entity:e-focustaiwan"],"groundedIn":["urn:trace:run:9e101404-9b68-4941-9c47-6b903f0472d6:Quotation:c-lai-deterrence-e1","urn:trace:run:9e101404-9b68-4941-9c47-6b903f0472d6:Quotation:c-lai-deterrence-e2","urn:trace:run:9e101404-9b68-4941-9c47-6b903f0472d6:Quotation:c-lai-deterrence-e3"],"hasOrigin":["urn:trace:run:9e101404-9b68-4941-9c47-6b903f0472d6:OriginGroup:c-lai-deterrence%3Aorigin-7798e73bbf0d"]},{"@id":"urn:trace:run:9e101404-9b68-4941-9c47-6b903f0472d6:Quotation:c-lai-deterrence-e1","@type":"Quotation","label":"私たちが防衛への投資を拡大するのは、挑発のためではなく、戦争を抑止するためです。","start":5579,"end":5619,"stance":"supports","wasDerivedFrom":["urn:trace:run:9e101404-9b68-4941-9c47-6b903f0472d6:DocumentSnapshot:source-24b7bf85-ae85-44e0-afe0-7c46718097c6"]},{"@id":"urn:trace:run:9e101404-9b68-4941-9c47-6b903f0472d6:Quotation:c-lai-deterrence-e2","@type":"Quotation","label":"私たちは国防改革を継続し、非対称戦力を強化するとともに、自主的な防衛産業の発展に取り組んでいます","start":5246,"end":5294,"stance":"supports","wasDerivedFrom":["urn:trace:run:9e101404-9b68-4941-9c47-6b903f0472d6:DocumentSnapshot:source-24b7bf85-ae85-44e0-afe0-7c46718097c6"]},{"@id":"urn:trace:run:9e101404-9b68-4941-9c47-6b903f0472d6:Quotation:c-lai-deterrence-e3","@type":"Quotation","label":"インド太平洋地域の民主主義国家はその力を結集すべきであり、地域の平和と安定という現状が変更されることを許してはなりません","start":5836,"end":5896,"stance":"supports","wasDerivedFrom":["urn:trace:run:9e101404-9b68-4941-9c47-6b903f0472d6:DocumentSnapshot:source-24b7bf85-ae85-44e0-afe0-7c46718097c6"]},{"@id":"urn:trace:run:9e101404-9b68-4941-9c47-6b903f0472d6:OriginGroup:c-lai-deterrence%3Aorigin-7798e73bbf0d","@type":"OriginGroup","label":"japan.focustaiwan.tw","originVerified":true,"independence":"unconfirmed","wasDerivedFrom":["urn:trace:run:9e101404-9b68-4941-9c47